WEBVTT

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:03.910
So you're the Black Wind?

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:09.150
Those guys were pathetic.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.100
I gave them just the slightest
bit of punishment,

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.610
and they started screaming
and begging for their lives.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.530
For Rank A adventurers, they sure
screamed like little girls.

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:19.280
Being weak doesn't mean you're good or bad,

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:21.400
but I certainly wouldn't
want to end up like them.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.250
Wouldn't you agree,

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:24.730
um...

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:27.750
Toya Kanzaki, Hero of Deramis!

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.660
And his companion, Setsuna Shiga!

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:31.380
Nana Mizuoka!

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:32.860
Miyabi Kuromiya.

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:39.640
Our job is to protect the people from
thugs like you—to deliver justice!

00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:44.890
Bandits of the Black Wind, we will defeat
you in the name of justice!

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:48.680
What's so funny?

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:53.660
You're gonna have to get a
lot stronger first, kid.

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:55.110
You bastard!

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:57.560
Toya, he's trying to provoke you!

00:00:57.560 --> 00:01:00.070
Let's play a game.

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:01.960
A game?

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:06.090
A battle between me and the four of you.

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:09.940
And the loser has to grant
the winner any one wish.

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:11.590
How about that?

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:13.550
Our side has too much of an advantage.

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:15.760
What are you thinking?

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:18.020
We can't fight you in such a cowardly manner!

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:19.580
I'll take you on alone!

00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:20.880
No, Toya!

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.120
Setsuna...

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:25.840
He's hiding something.

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:28.530
You can't fight him alone.
We have to do this together!

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:30.980
But...

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:34.240
I can't tell how much magical power he has.

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:37.080
But it's probably more than me.
We should be careful.

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:40.880
Kanzaki, we need to work
together like we always do!

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:43.790
Nana, Miyabi...

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:45.370
Okay!

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:48.540
We accept your challenge!

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:00.180
Black Summoner

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:21.930
Here you go.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:23.560
Thanks, Gerard.

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:28.720
I still can't believe it's
going this well, though.

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:33.710
If you use your wish to have the
heroes testify about the slavers,

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:37.770
Christoph and the others won't be
able to have Trycen protect them.

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:40.100
That's the plan, right, Master?

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:41.390
Correct!

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:43.530
We're lucky the kid's so thick.

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.110
Still, you went through all the trouble
of taking the Black Wind's place,

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:48.000
just to have a fight with the heroes?

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.760
You're a real... uh...

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:52.120
Battle junkie!

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:53.370
That's the one!

00:03:54.870 --> 00:03:56.700
Guys, focus.

00:03:57.360 --> 00:04:01.530
We need them to be serious,
or there's no point, right?

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:06.630
How come you're the only one that
gets to fight, though, Kelvin?

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:09.580
You got to beat people up
on the way here, right?

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:11.470
I wanted to fight, too!

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:14.750
Efil, go get the basket.

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:15.630
Okay!

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:18.110
Here you are. Eat up.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:21.150
What are these? They look delicious.

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:25.160
For this one, just eat some
sandwiches and watch.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:30.090
But, Master, I don't think you
should be fighting alone either.

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:31.390
Efil?

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:35.610
It's true that all of them
are lower level than you.

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:38.920
But you're not a front-line fighter.

