00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:41.530
It's too dangerous to
take them all on alone.

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:46.650
They each seem to have some kind
of strange unique skill, too.

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:50.110
Part of the goal of this
battle is to test solutions

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:52.920
to one of my weak points,
which is fighting against groups.

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:54.710
So you'll be using that thing?

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:55.930
Yup.

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:59.320
That's why I have this
new item, the Skill Eater.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:59.980
Skill Eater (Rank S)

00:04:59.970 --> 00:05:02.650
Look at how evil he is!

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:07.710
He's the boss of a gang that kidnaps
people, steals, and tortures!

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:11.900
We can't lose this battle,
even at the cost of our lives!

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:14.500
Lightfairy, lend me your power!

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:17.530
Windfairy, help me!

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:20.390
I'm counting on you, Waterfairy!

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:24.220
Help me out a little, Darkfairy.

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:28.750
So that's Fairy's Grace skills?

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:29.970
Interesting.

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:32.880
Here I come, Black Wind!

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:36.760
So you decided to try and get in
close, assuming I'm a caster?

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:37.790
Good choice.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:39.920
Radiance Lancer!

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:46.410
He's supposed to be a caster!

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:48.190
Why is he getting so close?

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:49.550
Is he insane?

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.620
Come on out, Munnie!

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:55.690
A dragon?

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:57.580
Flame Breath!

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:59.410
Sonic Accelerate!

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:00.250
So fast!

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.090
An agility-buffing spell?

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:04.260
Yup!

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.530
I'll be borrowing that. Skill Eater!

00:06:13.090 --> 00:06:18.420
So that's the power of the new
item he made from Victor's armor?

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:23.100
Skill Eater: a glove that can copy an
enemy's skill just by touching them.

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:27.810
He's got one on each hand,
so he can copy up to two skills at once.

00:06:27.810 --> 00:06:31.900
But each time he copies a new skill,
he'll lose the old one.

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:39.860
Your unique skill,
Parallel Thinking, is mine now.

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:43.340
It's not fair he gets to copy unique skills.

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:49.160
Hey, you let him copy something, too, right?

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:52.900
Yeah, you'll just have to guess what.

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:55.360
Get away from Miyabi!

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:58.890
Whoa, there.

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:01.810
Wait!

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:04.080
Miyabi, are you okay?

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:05.780
Light Heal.

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:09.650
Miyabi?

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:14.340
He made me dirty...

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:17.160
What did you do to Miyabi?!

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.800
Don't worry. I didn't do anything!

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.920
Nana, keep healing Miyabi!

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:24.500
Setsuna, protect them!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:25.500
No!

00:07:24.890 --> 00:07:25.860
Kanzaki!

00:07:25.860 --> 00:07:26.770
I'll...

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.450
handle him personally!

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:34.520
You gave up your numbers advantage without
having any idea how strong I am.

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:36.620
You'll never be able to win like that!

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:37.690
Shut up!

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:40.850
I'm better with a sword than you are!
I know that much!

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:46.220
I guess it'll take more training
than that to keep up with him.

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:48.690
I'll stay close to you
so you can't use magic!

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:50.490
Smart thinking.

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:53.480
So, how will you handle this?

00:07:56.570 --> 00:07:57.940
I'm not done yet!

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:07.250
Too slow!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:12.630
You're kidding me...

00:08:13.140 --> 00:08:17.260
Toya's got Rank S Swordsmanship...
and he's fighting him bare-handed?!

00:08:19.520 --> 00:08:22.500
So that's what you lent him?

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:23.020
Yup.

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:26.310
My Rank S Martial Arts skill.

00:08:29.430 --> 00:08:30.670
Damn it!

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:33.690
Toya, you can't handle him on your own!

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:35.650
Reinforcements?

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:38.200
Adamantine Rampart!

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:45.940
That's the level above
Earthen Rampart, right?

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:49.650
Even I'd have to punch it a
few times to break through.

00:08:50.150 --> 00:08:52.620
Hey, this meat in the middle's great.

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:55.860
Setsuna!

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:56.850
Right!

00:08:57.460 --> 00:08:59.290
Executing Zantetsu-can!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.520
Zantetsu-can

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:12.150
Seriously?! She destroyed it with one hit?

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:13.610
A unique skill, huh?

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:17.870
If it can cut through anything without
regard for its level or hardness,

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:19.620
it's quite the threat.

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:22.040
But Master can...

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:25.940
No!

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.240
Setsuna!

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:34.760
Kanzaki!

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:35.630
Setsuna!

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:40.580
Are you okay?

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:41.670
Yeah.

00:09:43.510 --> 00:09:45.690
Oh, no! I'll use a Light Heal!

00:09:45.690 --> 00:09:47.560
I'm just fine.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:48.340
But...

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:52.080
I have to defeat the Demon King!

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:55.810
I have a duty to save
this world and bring peace!

00:09:55.810 --> 00:09:59.330
I have to be able to beat
a thug like him by myself!

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:06.150
Setsuna?

00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:12.740
Think about yourself for
once, justice-brain!

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:18.460
This is really awkward.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:23.430
Setsuna...

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:29.520
On that day, when we were all
talking in the classroom...

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:33.380
A magic circle suddenly
appeared on the floor...

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:37.800
And in our dreams, we saw a goddess.

00:10:43.180 --> 00:10:47.200
We woke up in the Deramis Great Cathedral.

00:10:48.030 --> 00:10:54.870
Heroes, I am Colette Deramilius, a priestess
of this land, and the one who summoned you.

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:59.310
Would you hear what I have to say?

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:03.960
I was so scared in this new world.

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:08.930
But I was able to make it this far because
the four of us were always together.

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:12.140
So, Toya, why do you...

00:11:12.360 --> 00:11:13.600
Setsuna...

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:16.840
Setsuna is right, Kanzaki!

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:19.190
You're always trying to
do everything yourself!

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:21.110
I don't want that!

00:11:21.110 --> 00:11:22.180
Nana...

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:26.550
If we don't work together like we practiced,
we can't use our full power...

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:27.450
Miyabi...

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:32.290
Everybody thinks you're strong,
and righteous, and amazing.

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:33.870
But that's not enough!

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:36.420
You can't do it all yourself!

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:41.090
You need to let us help too,
or you'll never beat the Demon King!

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:43.420
You're not the only hero!

00:11:43.420 --> 00:11:46.340
Please, calm down and think!

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:47.490
Setsuna...

00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:51.350
Everyone...

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:59.410
Sorry. I wasn't thinking straight.

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:04.580
All four of us are heroes together!

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:10.960
Name: Setsuna Shiga
Level: 52 Title: Hero from Another World
HP 477/477
MP 318/318
Age 18 | Strength 316
Race: Human | Endurance 219
Sex: Female | Agility 573
Class: Samurai | Magic 155
Luck 214
Skills: Zantetsu-can (Unique Skill)  Swordsmanship (A)
Mind's Eye (B) Heavenswalk (B)
Detect Danger (B) Fast Reflexes (B)
Assist Effects
Windfairy's Grace | Concealment (B)

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:10.960
Black Summoner

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:12.910
Um...

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:14.410
You guys done?

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:16.600
Yeah. Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:18.560
Now, then...

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:23.360
A light fairy to blind him?

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:24.750
Clever.

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:27.990
Fairies don't show up on
Detect Presence, huh?

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:31.280
But trying to blind me by getting
one close without me noticing...

00:12:31.280 --> 00:12:33.140
They're getting clever!

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:34.690
Frostbound!

00:12:40.060 --> 00:12:41.470
Felony Crush!

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:46.890
The ground froze, and I can't move!

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:50.090
And this weight I'm feeling...
A type of air pressure?

00:12:50.090 --> 00:12:51.170
This is the end!

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:52.290
You can't dodge now!

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:53.690
Master!

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:57.590
Cleft Detonation!

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:02.670
He self-destructed?

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:05.820
Without the Lightfairy’s shield,
I would've been in danger.

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.400
Setsuna, are you okay?

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:10.070
I think so.

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:12.350
Without my Heavenswalk skill
that lets me move in mid-air,

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:15.800
and the Windfairy's speed boost,
I don't know if I would've survived.

00:13:16.160 --> 00:13:17.660
Are you okay?

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:21.880
I'd like to think that explosion
did some damage to him, too.

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:23.250
Blind Cure.

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:27.700
A white magic spell to
restore his lost sight!

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:32.720
That was good teamwork.

00:13:32.720 --> 00:13:34.660
You had me scared for a second.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.440
He's undamaged?

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:40.620
He destroyed the ground under
him to cancel my Frostbound!

00:13:40.620 --> 00:13:44.060
I'm not ending the game
with my own spell, duh.

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:46.380
Of course I can control it.

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:48.880
Now, honestly, you two in the back.

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:51.800
Y-Yes?

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:56.260
After the debuff spells, I would've liked to see
you follow up with some attack spells.

00:13:56.970 --> 00:13:59.270
I'll never forgive you for
humiliating me twice.

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:01.680
Wow, you're the type to hold a grudge, huh?

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:06.140
You with the ponytail, you should be trying
to work Heavenswalk into your attacks.

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:09.120
They're too easy to read right now.

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:15.280
And you, when are you going
to use your dual-wield?

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:17.300
Appraising Eye?

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:20.330
Very well... I'll show you!

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:24.210
To be honest, I never dreamed that
a bandit could be so strong.

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:27.280
But now, I'll use my full strength!

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:30.490
Holy Sword Wil, reveal your true form!

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:43.650
There he goes again...

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:45.510
But fine.

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:48.130
Toya, I'll help you!

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:49.110
Me, too!

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:51.500
Frozen Temple!

00:14:57.320 --> 00:14:58.130
What's this?

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:03.070
Get ready! This is the most
powerful spell I have!

00:15:03.070 --> 00:15:07.210
Your whole body will be frozen
stiff as long as you're inside it!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:09.500
Your assist magic won't activate, either!

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:11.840
I see.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:14.850
I can move a little, but I can't fight.

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:17.360
And that assist canceler is a problem, too.

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:20.200
You'll pay for the years of
humiliation I've endured!

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:24.490
Gravedeath Ogre!

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:30.780
I'm pretty sure we just met today.

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:33.680
Oh? Are you in trouble?

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:36.000
Want some help, Kelvin?

00:15:37.190 --> 00:15:40.440
Hey, that's not funny, Sera.

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:47.050
Gloom Lancer!

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:52.460
It's finally getting fun!

00:15:56.850 --> 00:15:59.670
Wake up! Adamantine Guardian!

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:02.680
Adamantine Guardian

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:10.160
Golems?

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:13.330
Delay them for just 30 seconds!

00:16:15.910 --> 00:16:19.880
This Frozen Temple that's stopping
me from moving is bad news.

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:22.930
I've never tried this before,
but I'll have to go for it.

00:16:23.440 --> 00:16:25.550
Sharpen your senses.

00:16:25.970 --> 00:16:28.330
Steady your breathing. Focus!

00:16:28.990 --> 00:16:31.260
Is Master...?

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:36.850
Yeah, that's probably why he copied
Parallel Thought from the girl.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:38.350
Impossible...

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:39.690
Miyabi?

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:42.720
He's... making something.

00:16:42.720 --> 00:16:44.320
Making what?

00:16:44.590 --> 00:16:45.820
A new spell!

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:51.420
What I'm doing now is creating the
incantations needed for a new spell.

00:16:51.420 --> 00:16:55.810
Normally, creating the precise mental images

00:16:55.810 --> 00:16:58.470
and necessary incantations for a new spell

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:02.490
is a long, complex process
with many difficult steps,

00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:06.640
but with Parallel Thought, I can do
all of that at once, at hyperspeed!

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:07.840
And...

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:11.420
Setsuna, hurry! He's making a new spell!

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:12.150
Roger!

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:15.990
Executing... Zantetsu-can!

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:21.590
Creation complete!

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:25.540
Radiance Crossfire!

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:33.620
How did he know how to defeat Frozen Temple?

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:36.400
How did he know that you had to
destroy the ice pillars all at once?

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:42.090
I can analyze anything with my
Appraising Eye, including magic.

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:47.840
I already had the answer before you
were finished explaining the spell.

00:17:48.320 --> 00:17:49.380
It's not over yet!

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:56.970
So you're already incorporating
Heavenswalk into your attacks?

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:59.720
You've got the best combat
sense of any of your party.

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:01.400
Take this!

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:06.470
But I'm far faster!

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:10.220
Setsuna!

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:12.780
Don't let your guard down.

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:17.000
That Gravedeath Ogre is incredibly powerful!

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:20.120
And she's put status-effect-inducing
black magic on it!

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:23.200
Dangerous, but...!

00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:29.280
All of them are far weaker than Sera's.

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:31.380
Miyabi!

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:36.800
Kanzaki! I'll shield you, so go for it!

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:38.640
Wait, Nana!

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:42.720
Protect us! Icicle Shield!

00:18:45.190 --> 00:18:49.090
Huh, her Endurance rivals Sera's.

00:18:49.090 --> 00:18:50.030
But...

00:18:50.030 --> 00:18:52.100
Glory's Sanctuary!

00:18:59.260 --> 00:19:03.250
That barrier's capable of
temporarily sealing a Rank S demon.

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:05.250
You're not strong enough to break it yet.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:07.640
Hyper Impact!

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:18.680
How dare you hurt my friends, you bastard?!

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:21.300
As for you, you're a bit of a disappointment.

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:24.670
If you have all this strength, why don't
you use it for the sake of the world?

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:34.690
The way you think is how a hero should be,

00:19:36.090 --> 00:19:39.460
but don't try to force your ideals on me.

00:19:40.060 --> 00:19:42.290
That won't cut it in this world.

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:44.910
If you want to change the world, get stronger.

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:48.600
And if you can't...
then just lie there and whine!

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:53.140
I'm sorry, everyone...

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:59.140
Name: Nana Mizuoka
Level: 48 Title: Hero from Another World
HP 294/294
MP 589/589
Age: 18 | Strength 143
Race: Human | Endurance 493
Sex: Female | Agility 95
Class: Tamer  | Magic 347
Luck 191
Skills:
Talks to Animals (Unique Skill) | Blue Magic (B)
White Magic (B) | Taming (A)
Diplomacy (C) | Iron Wall (B)
Assist Effects:
Waterfairy's Grace | Concealment (B)

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:59.140
Black Summoner

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:03.550
And Mom makes the best stews!

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:07.480
Oh, yeah? But our Efil's a good chef, too...

00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:10.600
I've heard these voices somewhere...

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:12.690
Toya!

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:13.890
He's awake!

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:15.080
I'm so glad!

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:16.620
I...

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:19.560
I still think Mom's is best!

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:23.220
But if you insist, we can compare them!

00:20:25.190 --> 00:20:27.150
Get away from the girl!

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:30.130
Oh, you're awake, young lad.

00:20:30.130 --> 00:20:32.190
You're even putting your
filthy hands on young girls?

00:20:32.190 --> 00:20:34.490
No, idiot. Look carefully.

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:37.030
A slime?

00:20:37.030 --> 00:20:40.620
Wait, so the adventurers who came
to rescue the people here...

00:20:40.930 --> 00:20:44.080
This is my slime, Clotho.

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:49.250
So you're the adventurers
who came ahead of us, then?

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:53.720
That's right! I told you,
he was the one who saved us!

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:56.790
Yeah, that's how it is. Sorry.

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:58.680
I'm Kelvin, an adventurer.

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:05.220
No... Then we were wrong from the start?

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:09.460
Well, Kelvin went through a lot of trouble
to make sure you'd get it wrong.

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:12.500
Sera, shh!

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:16.250
But then, why did we have to fight?

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:18.880
We could've talked it out!

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:22.210
You should be trying to work
Heavenswalk into your attacks.

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:25.420
When are you going to use your dual-wield?

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:26.850
Don't tell me...

00:21:27.710 --> 00:21:29.510
That's right, Toya.

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:31.350
You're probably right.

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:35.810
Kelvin! You win!

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:41.060
You're a better fighter, and person,
than we are! I'm so sorry!

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:45.020
No sense in worrying about the past.

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:51.080
Anyway, if you'll grant my wish from
the game, I won't have any complaints.

00:21:51.570 --> 00:21:54.940
Of course! I'm prepared to endure any trial!

00:21:54.940 --> 00:21:57.960
Kelvin, no... Teacher!

00:21:58.480 --> 00:22:00.230
I see.

00:22:00.230 --> 00:22:02.850
Then start stripping.

00:22:06.760 --> 00:22:09.970
EP 07: Battle with the Heroes
